OL,3,ABurnham says he'll ignore 'stuck in the
OL,4,Apast' former PMs after striking UK-EU
OL,5,Adeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham says he will ignore "stuck
OL,8,Fin the past" former prime ministers who
OL,9,Fhave criticised his approach to the EU
OL,10,F- what have they said?
OL,12,FThe prime minister will set out his new
OL,13,FUK-EU deal in the House of Commons this
OL,14,Fafternoon, after it was agreed with
OL,15,FEuropean leaders on Friday
OL,17,FThe deal includes a youth mobility
OL,18,Fscheme, scrapping most checks on
OL,19,FBritish food exports, and the linking
OL,20,Fof EU and UK emissions trading systems
OL,21,F- see a recap here
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
